{"title": "Evasive Instinct", "pageid": 28429, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Evasive_Instinct", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Evasive Instinct</b> is a passive feature that increases your defenses so long as you're not wearing armor.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> as long as you are not wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a> or holding a <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">shield</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Boots\" title=\"Bonespike Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Boots\" title=\"Bonespike Boots\">Bonespike Boots</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\">Helldusk Armour</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain\" title=\"Elven Chain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Elven_Chain_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elven_Chain\" title=\"Elven Chain\">Elven Chain</a> lack an <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_proficiency\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armour proficiency\">armour proficiency</a> group, and so can be worn by any character without incurring the normal penalties for lacking proficiency. Because they lack a proficiency group, both armours are not seen as armour proper by Evasive Instinct and can therefore be used in combination with it.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204826\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1878/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15599/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5780/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 970024/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.603      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   46.603      1 -total\n 31.51%   14.684      3 Template:Item_icon\n 23.70%   11.047      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 23.24%   10.828     22 Template:Trim\n 20.93%    9.753      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 20.57%    9.585      2 Template:Icon_text\n 20.17%    9.402      1 Template:ArmourClass\n 19.56%    9.116      8 Template:Ifempty\n 19.08%    8.894      1 Template:WeaponProperty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28429-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714204826 and revision id 397887. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}